==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|graphologie}}, coined by {{w|Jean-Hippolyte Michon}} from {{cog|grc|γραφή||writing}} + {{cog|fr|-logie||study of}}. {{surf|en|grapho-|-logy}}.

